        <name>operator++</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Advance the iterator.</para><para>Advances the iterator to the next AST node in a depth-first pre-order search. If the <ref refid="classRoseAst_1_1iterator_1accd31773e3396ce9a5b4c7ffa44c1c94" kindref="member">skipChildrenOnForward</ref> flag is set then all children of the current node are skipped and the <ref refid="classRoseAst_1_1iterator_1accd31773e3396ce9a5b4c7ffa44c1c94" kindref="member">skipChildrenOnForward</ref> flag is cleared. If the <ref refid="classRoseAst_1_1iterator_1aa38271b735f7bc9216d5b03d7ad686bf" kindref="member">withoutNullValues</ref> flag is set, then all null child pointers are skipped but that flag is not cleared. </para>        </detaileddescription>
